sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Manager as Manager / Game Launcher
    participant Host as Runtime Host
    participant Pipe as Broker Named Pipe
    participant Broker as Privileged Broker
    participant Win as Windows

    User->>Manager: semantic action
    Manager->>Host: UI command
    Host->>Host: owner validation / policy / state guards

    Host->>Pipe: connect to S<SessionId> pipe
    Pipe->>Broker: accepted connection
    Broker->>Broker: derive client SessionId + PID
    Broker->>Broker: validate console owner + user/logon SID
    Broker->>Broker: validate RuntimeHost image/release/protocol
    Broker-->>Host: HelloAck / capabilities

    Host->>Broker: allowlisted capability request\nrequestId + operationId + idempotencyKey
    Broker->>Broker: schema + authorization + target allowlist
    Broker->>Win: bounded machine mutation
    Win-->>Broker: immediate technical result
    Broker->>Win: read actual state where applicable
    Win-->>Broker: actual evidence
    Broker-->>Host: technical result + verification evidence

    Host->>Host: semantic owner decides commit/failure/rollback
    Host-->>Manager: state/result update
    Manager-->>User: observable outcome
